# 07-mcp-servers: Authentifier un serveur MCP distant OAuth

Output mcp-oauth-demo.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set BorderRadius 8
Set Margin 10
Set MarginFill "#282a36"
Set Framerate 10
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "copilot"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "Show the safe steps to authenticate the configured remote OAuth MCP server and explain what data it can access."
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 20s

Type " "
Backspace
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
